Lava Lance conjures a spear of molten rock that streaks toward the target
with deadly precision. The superheated magma burns through armor and flesh
alike, dealing intense fire damage on impact.

Usage: cast 'lava lance' <target>

This spell combines earth and fire magic to create one of the most
devastating single-target attacks available to mages. The molten lance
burns at extreme temperatures, making it particularly effective against
creatures vulnerable to fire.

The spell requires precise aim and magical control to form the lava into
a coherent projectile. Masters of this spell can punch through even
heavily armored opponents.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Fire

See Also: FIREBALL, INFERNO, FLAMESTRIKE
